WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.371 --> 00:00:03.737
-It has now become clear
in the post-Trump era

00:00:03.737 --> 00:00:05.372
that the core
ideological principle

00:00:05.372 --> 00:00:07.206
that binds the Republican Party
together

00:00:07.206 --> 00:00:08.741
is its contempt for democracy

00:00:08.741 --> 00:00:10.576
and its commitment
to the deranged lie

00:00:10.576 --> 00:00:12.245
that the 2020 election
was stolen.

00:00:12.245 --> 00:00:14.446
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:14.446 --> 00:00:18.151
[ Theme music plays ]

00:00:18.151 --> 00:00:20.653
The Republican Party has
attempted to rebrand itself

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:21.721
in the post-Trump era

00:00:21.721 --> 00:00:24.023
as some sort of populist
pro-worker party,

00:00:24.023 --> 00:00:25.324
which is, of course, ludicrous,

00:00:25.324 --> 00:00:27.793
'cause it's all just
a [bleep] rebranding exercise.

00:00:27.793 --> 00:00:29.962
It's the only thing
ever cared about -- branding.

00:00:29.962 --> 00:00:31.397
For example,
he repeatedly claimed

00:00:31.397 --> 00:00:33.299
throughout his presidency
that he was taking on

00:00:33.299 --> 00:00:35.234
the drug companies to lower
prices for Americans,

00:00:35.234 --> 00:00:37.103
including in
his farewell address

00:00:37.103 --> 00:00:38.504
just before leaving office.

00:00:38.504 --> 00:00:40.974
-Last month,
I took on Big Pharma.

00:00:40.974 --> 00:00:44.677
The drug companies don't exactly
like me too much lately.

00:00:44.677 --> 00:00:45.845
Big Pharma.

00:00:45.845 --> 00:00:47.213
And the drug companies
hate me.

00:00:47.213 --> 00:00:49.248
[ Cheers and applause ]
They don't like me.

00:00:49.248 --> 00:00:50.984
Big Pharma is not
a big fan of mine.

00:00:50.984 --> 00:00:52.886
And the drug companies,
Big Pharma,

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:55.554
does not exactly like
your favorite president,

00:00:55.554 --> 00:00:57.556
I will tell you,
but that's okay.

00:00:57.556 --> 00:01:00.726
Essentially we're holding
Big Pharma accountable.

00:01:00.726 --> 00:01:03.696
I don't need Big Pharma.
They don't help me.

00:01:03.696 --> 00:01:05.531
We have Big Pharma against us.

00:01:05.531 --> 00:01:08.667
We created choice and
transparency in healthcare,

00:01:08.667 --> 00:01:11.704
stood up to Big Pharma
in so many ways.

00:01:11.704 --> 00:01:14.573
They do not like me this much.
It's big --

00:01:14.573 --> 00:01:16.943
They call it Big Pharma.
-Sometimes I think he says

00:01:16.943 --> 00:01:18.811
"they call it"
because he wants to get credit

00:01:18.811 --> 00:01:20.580
for teaching you
a thing you already know.

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:23.082
Other times, I think he says it
because he doesn't want you

00:01:23.082 --> 00:01:24.650
thinking
he came up with that name.

00:01:24.650 --> 00:01:27.386
"They call it Big Pharma,
but I call it --

00:01:27.386 --> 00:01:28.921
wait for this -- Phony Pharma,

00:01:28.921 --> 00:01:31.023
with Fishy Pfizer,
Mad Moderna,

00:01:31.023 --> 00:01:33.493
and of course, worst of all,
Jerkson &amp; Jerkson.

00:01:33.493 --> 00:01:35.761
Of course, that promise
turned out to be empty.

00:01:35.761 --> 00:01:38.331
All he did was sign a few
meaningless executive orders

00:01:38.331 --> 00:01:40.265
and promise legislation
that never came.

00:01:40.265 --> 00:01:42.835
In fact, after he himself
got COVID during the campaign,

00:01:42.835 --> 00:01:45.805
he announced that he would make
the experimental cocktail

00:01:45.805 --> 00:01:48.108
he received in the hospital
free for all Americans --

00:01:48.108 --> 00:01:50.376
a promise
that suspiciously disappeared

00:01:50.376 --> 00:01:51.511
after he made it.

00:01:51.511 --> 00:01:54.213
-I have
emergency use authorization

00:01:54.213 --> 00:01:57.450
all set, and
we got to get it signed now.

00:01:57.450 --> 00:02:00.085
I want to get for you
what I got.

00:02:00.085 --> 00:02:02.956
And I'm gonna make it free.
You're not gonna pay for it.

00:02:02.956 --> 00:02:05.325
I want everybody to be given

00:02:05.325 --> 00:02:07.860
the same treatment
as your president.

00:02:07.860 --> 00:02:11.631
Because I feel great.
I feel, like, perfect.

00:02:11.631 --> 00:02:14.566
-Well, you look perfect, too.
I wonder how he's doing now?

00:02:14.566 --> 00:02:18.070
Aah! Oh.
He looks like he drowned

00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:19.672
in the water hazard
on the 18th hole.

00:02:19.672 --> 00:02:21.540
When Ted Cruz
flew down to Mar-a-Lago,

00:02:21.540 --> 00:02:23.309
die he meet with Trump
or the ghost of Trump?

00:02:23.309 --> 00:02:25.044
Also, anytime
a con artist like Trump

00:02:25.044 --> 00:02:26.913
promises to give you
something for free,

00:02:26.913 --> 00:02:28.247
you should be skeptical.
I'm sure,

00:02:28.247 --> 00:02:30.349
at the end of that lunch,
Trump stuck Cruz with the check.

00:02:30.349 --> 00:02:32.952
"$600?
All I had was a coffee,

00:02:32.952 --> 00:02:34.787
and he put his fingers
in it twice."

00:02:34.787 --> 00:02:36.823
The point is,
Trump pretended he was a warrior

00:02:36.823 --> 00:02:38.958
against Big Pharma, but,
of course, it was all a lie.

00:02:38.958 --> 00:02:41.160
Meanwhile, yesterday
the Biden administration

00:02:41.160 --> 00:02:43.462
actually did take on
the pharmaceutical industry

00:02:43.462 --> 00:02:45.230
with a historic and
shocking move

00:02:45.230 --> 00:02:47.967
that surprised almost everyone
and will do immense good.

00:02:47.967 --> 00:02:50.169
-U.S. trade representative
Katherine Tai

00:02:50.169 --> 00:02:52.371
delivered lifesaving news
today,

00:02:52.371 --> 00:02:54.707
when she announced the
Biden administration's support

00:02:54.707 --> 00:02:57.876
for lifting intellectual
property protections

00:02:57.876 --> 00:02:59.846
for coronavirus vaccines.

00:02:59.846 --> 00:03:02.114
The waiver would allow
developing countries

00:03:02.114 --> 00:03:03.883
to access the information

00:03:03.883 --> 00:03:06.719
to produce their own
generic vaccines

00:03:06.719 --> 00:03:09.355
instead of waiting
months or years

00:03:09.355 --> 00:03:12.425
for adequate supply from
the pharmaceutical companies

00:03:12.425 --> 00:03:14.226
that developed the vaccines.

00:03:14.226 --> 00:03:17.963
-Moderna stock is taking a hit.
It's down 8% now.

00:03:17.963 --> 00:03:20.133
Of course, it dropped yesterday
on the news

00:03:20.133 --> 00:03:22.868
after the market closed,
but this is really affecting

00:03:22.868 --> 00:03:25.337
all of these companies
in the vaccine space.

00:03:25.337 --> 00:03:28.274
If you look at Novavax,
which is expecting Phase 3 data

00:03:28.274 --> 00:03:30.409
here in the U.S. soon
for its COVID vaccine;

00:03:30.409 --> 00:03:32.445
CureVac, which is
another mRNA player,

00:03:32.445 --> 00:03:34.113
which is expecting data soon;

00:03:34.113 --> 00:03:36.415
BioNTech, of course,
which is Pfizer's partner --

00:03:36.415 --> 00:03:39.085
all of these stocks down
about 7% to 9%

00:03:39.085 --> 00:03:40.620
on this patent news.
-Wow.

00:03:40.620 --> 00:03:42.622
Joe Biden,
scourge of Big Pharma.

00:03:42.622 --> 00:03:44.924
Who would have thunk it?
Although, to me, it makes sense,

00:03:44.924 --> 00:03:47.226
because Biden does have
the energy of a grandpa

00:03:47.226 --> 00:03:49.295
who refuses to take
over-the-counter meds

00:03:49.295 --> 00:03:52.198
and insists a swim in the lake
will cure his back pain.

00:03:52.198 --> 00:03:54.033
"In my day,
if you had a backache,

00:03:54.033 --> 00:03:56.668
you ate some ground liverwort
and rubbed some vinegar on it.

00:03:56.668 --> 00:03:58.204
And if it got really bad,

00:03:58.204 --> 00:04:01.107
you went down
to Dr. Bonkers' medical wagon

00:04:01.107 --> 00:04:02.608
and drank some of
his magic elixir.

00:04:02.608 --> 00:04:05.044
It didn't have no Tylenol
or ibuprofen in it.

00:04:05.044 --> 00:04:07.413
Just straight whiskey
and cocaine."

00:04:07.413 --> 00:04:09.649
But it's truly difficult
to underscore

00:04:09.649 --> 00:04:11.684
just how monumental and historic
this is.

00:04:11.684 --> 00:04:14.754
With one decision, Joe Biden
sent Big Pharma stock prices

00:04:14.754 --> 00:04:17.056
plummeting and
put people's lives over profits,

00:04:17.056 --> 00:04:19.792
and he didn't make a big, flashy
Rose Garden announcement

00:04:19.792 --> 00:04:22.394
or film a weird video where
he's standing near the bushes

00:04:22.394 --> 00:04:24.597
outside the White House
like he lost his keys

00:04:24.597 --> 00:04:25.998
and is waiting
for his wife to get home.

00:04:25.998 --> 00:04:29.034
"Yeah, I know there's a plastic
rock with a key in it.

00:04:29.034 --> 00:04:31.403
But it looks like
all the other rocks.

00:04:31.403 --> 00:04:33.472
Yeah, well, they should
make one that says 'key' on it."

00:04:33.472 --> 00:04:35.041
Biden just did it.

00:04:35.041 --> 00:04:37.310
Honestly, he should
make a big, flashy announcement.

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:38.744
That's the one thing
Democrats are bad at.

00:04:38.744 --> 00:04:40.313
They like to be boring.
And I get it.

00:04:40.313 --> 00:04:42.548
After four years of nonstop
heart palpitations,

00:04:42.548 --> 00:04:43.916
I think we're all craving
some boredom.

00:04:43.916 --> 00:04:46.118
But Democrats should also be
out there telling voters

00:04:46.118 --> 00:04:48.354
they're the ones really
sticking it to Big Pharma

00:04:48.354 --> 00:04:50.857
while Donald Trump and Ted Cruz
hang out at Mar-a-Lago.

00:04:50.857 --> 00:04:54.526
Or the lobby of a Radisson.
I can't tell.

00:04:54.526 --> 00:04:56.528
And another thing --
it's amazing and revealing

00:04:56.528 --> 00:04:58.831
that it's this easy to just
waive the patent protections

00:04:58.831 --> 00:05:00.533
on a lifesaving vaccine
and save lives.

00:05:00.533 --> 00:05:02.935
Why can't we do this for other
medicines, like insulin?

00:05:02.935 --> 00:05:05.504
Because insulin prices
are a national disgrace.

00:05:05.504 --> 00:05:08.608
A patient paying roughly $175
for a vial of insulin

00:05:08.608 --> 00:05:11.043
15 years ago
might pay nearly $1,500

00:05:11.043 --> 00:05:13.145
for the same dose today,
and that's horrifying.

00:05:13.145 --> 00:05:15.414
It's a lifesaving medication,
not a rare Beanie Baby.

00:05:15.414 --> 00:05:17.283
The price of insulin
shouldn't rise more

00:05:17.283 --> 00:05:18.584
than the price of Pokémon cards,

00:05:18.584 --> 00:05:20.386
which -- true story --
are skyrocketing right now

00:05:20.386 --> 00:05:22.355
for reasons
I do not fully understand.

00:05:22.355 --> 00:05:24.623
But the bottom line is,
you need to dig through

00:05:24.623 --> 00:05:26.692
your closet
at your parents' house ASAP

00:05:26.692 --> 00:05:29.162
and see if you have
a 2002 Charizard,

00:05:29.162 --> 00:05:31.096
because if you do, you could be
rolling in cash right now,

00:05:31.096 --> 00:05:32.731
my friends.
I went back

00:05:32.731 --> 00:05:34.500
through all my Pokémon cards,
and all I had was

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:37.036
a bunch of worthless
Rattatattas --

00:05:37.036 --> 00:05:40.039
Tattas -- Rattata-tatas.

00:05:40.039 --> 00:05:41.306
[ Laughter ]

00:05:41.306 --> 00:05:44.444
Rattata -- Rattata-tatas.

00:05:44.444 --> 00:05:47.479
I -- I didn't collects them,

00:05:47.479 --> 00:05:49.148
and I don't know
what these words mean.

00:05:49.148 --> 00:05:50.750
[ Laughter ]

00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:53.486
And a 1983 Rollie Fingers.
There we go.

00:05:53.486 --> 00:05:55.688
And by the way, presumably,
a big part of the reason

00:05:55.688 --> 00:05:57.890
this happened is because of
pressure from progressives

00:05:57.890 --> 00:06:00.092
and activists on the left
pushing the Biden administration

00:06:00.092 --> 00:06:01.827
to do the right thing,
which is how it should be.

00:06:01.827 --> 00:06:03.362
On the right,
it goes in reverse.

00:06:03.362 --> 00:06:05.764
The GOP doesn't push Trump.
Trump pushes the GOP.

00:06:05.764 --> 00:06:07.366
And remember, Trump
is not even in government.

00:06:07.366 --> 00:06:09.401
He's a retired
semi-Amateur golfer

00:06:09.401 --> 00:06:11.370
living in
a weird, gothic swamp hotel

00:06:11.370 --> 00:06:13.172
with a bunch of
Palm Springs radiologists

00:06:13.172 --> 00:06:16.542
and Russian spies, and still
working Republican politicians

00:06:16.542 --> 00:06:18.611
have to constantly debase and
humiliate themselves

00:06:18.611 --> 00:06:20.213
just to please him,
which is why

00:06:20.213 --> 00:06:22.581
they all make the sad pilgrimage
to Mar-a-Lago

00:06:22.581 --> 00:06:24.550
to genuflect to him
like Cruz did,

00:06:24.550 --> 00:06:26.885
or like Kevin McCarthy did
a few months back.

00:06:26.885 --> 00:06:28.387
Remember this?
Looks like when

00:06:28.387 --> 00:06:30.523
the star of a movie takes
a picture with his stuntman.

00:06:30.523 --> 00:06:32.691
"The movie is about
a group of old bank robbers

00:06:32.691 --> 00:06:34.694
with young wives,
who decide to go for

00:06:34.694 --> 00:06:37.129
one last score and
rob the Taj Mahal.

00:06:37.129 --> 00:06:38.898
I play Big Red, the sexy one."

00:06:38.898 --> 00:06:40.833
It's also why Rudy Giuliani
shows up

00:06:40.833 --> 00:06:42.234
outside of
landscaping companies,

00:06:42.234 --> 00:06:44.437
screaming about
nonexistent voter fraud

00:06:44.437 --> 00:06:46.171
and then has to
keep his mouth shut

00:06:46.171 --> 00:06:48.474
when Trump stiffs him.
"Boss, I need the cash.

00:06:48.474 --> 00:06:50.143
I'm at an ATM,
and nothing's coming out."

00:06:50.143 --> 00:06:51.710
"Rudy, that a claw machine.

00:06:51.710 --> 00:06:54.013
Oh, boy, Rudy,
you done it again."

00:06:54.013 --> 00:06:56.749
"Wait, maybe I can grab enough
Beanie Babies to break even.

00:06:56.749 --> 00:06:58.917
Come on, Rudy. Oh, you got this.

00:06:58.917 --> 00:07:00.953
Damn it!
Alright, give me a brick!"

00:07:00.953 --> 00:07:03.222
So, clearly,
Republicans have no interest

00:07:03.222 --> 00:07:05.290
in actual pro-worker populism.

00:07:05.290 --> 00:07:07.827
They're just authoritarians,
who desperately crave power,

00:07:07.827 --> 00:07:10.630
which is why their sole
ideological commitment,

00:07:10.630 --> 00:07:11.763
the core of their movement,

00:07:11.763 --> 00:07:14.133
is the lie that the 2020
election was stolen

00:07:14.133 --> 00:07:16.068
from Donald Trump,
and now they're purging

00:07:16.068 --> 00:07:18.303
from their leadership
anyone who disagrees with them.

00:07:18.303 --> 00:07:21.140
Wyoming Congresswoman Liz Cheney
is just the latest

00:07:21.140 --> 00:07:22.541
and most prominent example.

00:07:22.541 --> 00:07:24.143
-Do you believe
she needs to go?

00:07:24.143 --> 00:07:26.579
And if so,
who should replace her?

00:07:26.579 --> 00:07:29.615
-Yes, she definitely needs do
go, and the speaker the right.

00:07:29.615 --> 00:07:32.117
We are
a pro-America populist party

00:07:32.117 --> 00:07:34.153
rooted in
conservative principle,

00:07:34.153 --> 00:07:35.721
with Donald Trump as our leader.

00:07:35.721 --> 00:07:38.824
You can't have a Republican
conference chair

00:07:38.824 --> 00:07:40.859
reciting
Democrat talking points.

00:07:40.859 --> 00:07:43.195
You can't have
a Republican conference chair

00:07:43.195 --> 00:07:46.832
taking a position that 90% of
the party disagrees with,

00:07:46.832 --> 00:07:49.735
and you can't have
a Republican Party chair

00:07:49.735 --> 00:07:52.537
consistently speaking out
against the individual

00:07:52.537 --> 00:07:55.641
who 74 million Americans
voted for.

00:07:55.641 --> 00:07:57.877
-First of all, Jim Jordan,
either dump the suit

00:07:57.877 --> 00:07:59.579
or wear a jacket.
You always look like you're

00:07:59.579 --> 00:08:01.713
begging Alec Baldwin for the
"Glengarry" lead.

00:08:01.713 --> 00:08:03.649
Second, the Democrat
talking points

00:08:03.649 --> 00:08:05.350
you're referring to
are just reality.

00:08:05.350 --> 00:08:07.686
Think about how deranged
what he's saying is.

00:08:07.686 --> 00:08:10.122
"We can't have leaders in our
party who believe in reality."

00:08:10.122 --> 00:08:11.824
It's like if
I instructed my staff

00:08:11.824 --> 00:08:14.226
not to question
my Vince Vaughn impression,

00:08:14.226 --> 00:08:17.496
even though I now conduct
all meetings as Vince Vaughn.

00:08:17.496 --> 00:08:19.765
"Buddy, buddy, buddy,
this sketch is not working.

00:08:19.765 --> 00:08:21.634
It breaks my heart to say it,
but it's true.

00:08:21.634 --> 00:08:23.235
You got to cut it in half
and add more jokes.

00:08:23.235 --> 00:08:25.171
Now, if you make those changes,
will I do it on the show?

00:08:25.171 --> 00:08:27.039
Probably not.
I have a reputation to maintain.

00:08:27.039 --> 00:08:29.374
But give it your best shot,
okay, pal?"

00:08:29.374 --> 00:08:32.377
"Alright, geez, man, relax."
[ Laughter ]

00:08:32.377 --> 00:08:35.080
Again, now I think...
[ Laughter ]

00:08:35.080 --> 00:08:37.817
Now I think the cold
has really brought it out.

00:08:37.817 --> 00:08:40.152
I think the worst thing
that will happen

00:08:40.152 --> 00:08:43.222
when my cold goes away
is the reversion

00:08:43.222 --> 00:08:45.624
to the poorer
Vince Vaughn impression.

00:08:45.624 --> 00:08:47.726
And again, I don't wanted to
side with Liz Cheney.

00:08:47.726 --> 00:08:49.562
She's a pro-war
torture apologist

00:08:49.562 --> 00:08:51.397
who supported Trump in 2016

00:08:51.397 --> 00:08:53.232
and helped make the modern GOP
what it is today.

00:08:53.232 --> 00:08:55.134
I feel B.J. Hunnicutt
speaking up

00:08:55.134 --> 00:08:57.036
in support
of Charles Winchester.

00:08:57.036 --> 00:08:59.938
[ Laughter ]

00:08:59.938 --> 00:09:01.674
But she's not being punished
for any of that.

00:09:01.674 --> 00:09:03.509
She's being punished
for simply stating reality.

00:09:03.509 --> 00:09:05.978
The GOP's fealty to a corrupt
and deeply unpopular

00:09:05.978 --> 00:09:08.180
ex-president
who never won the popular vote,

00:09:08.180 --> 00:09:10.549
never cracked 50% job approval,
and who fomented

00:09:10.549 --> 00:09:12.851
a violent insurrection
to overturn the election

00:09:12.851 --> 00:09:15.521
shows you just how deep
their contempt for democracy is.

00:09:15.521 --> 00:09:17.656
Rather than actually appeal
to a majority of voters,

00:09:17.656 --> 00:09:19.725
they'd rather just rig the game
so they always win.

00:09:19.725 --> 00:09:21.160
That's what they're doing
right now

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:22.961
with all these
voter-suppression laws.

00:09:22.961 --> 00:09:25.397
They're just trying to codify
Trump's big election lie

00:09:25.397 --> 00:09:27.032
and make it canon.
that's what happened

00:09:27.032 --> 00:09:29.068
this morning in Florida,
when Governor Ron DeSantis

00:09:29.068 --> 00:09:31.971
signed a law making it harder
to vote by mail or drop box.

00:09:31.971 --> 00:09:34.606
And in a bizarre and
deeply unnerving move,

00:09:34.606 --> 00:09:37.276
the bill signing was exclusively
aired on Fox News,

00:09:37.276 --> 00:09:39.578
with other media outlets barred
from entering the room.

00:09:39.578 --> 00:09:41.179
-Governor Ron DeSantis
just signed

00:09:41.179 --> 00:09:42.915
a controversial voting bill
into law.

00:09:42.915 --> 00:09:45.317
But you may have missed
that happening live,

00:09:45.317 --> 00:09:49.188
because local media were
not allowed inside the event.

00:09:49.188 --> 00:09:51.356
Instead, the governor opted
to only allow

00:09:51.356 --> 00:09:55.294
one national news outlet
to cover a bill signing

00:09:55.294 --> 00:09:57.563
that would impact the voters
in the state of Florida.

00:09:57.563 --> 00:09:59.532
All voters.
-He signed the bill

00:09:59.532 --> 00:10:02.301
from West Palm Beach,
live on Fox News.

00:10:02.301 --> 00:10:07.139
-What are you about to sign?
-So, right now, I have

00:10:07.139 --> 00:10:10.109
what we think is the strongest
election integrity measures

00:10:10.109 --> 00:10:11.443
in the country.
I'm actually gonna sign it

00:10:11.443 --> 00:10:13.045
right here.
It's gonna take effect --

00:10:13.045 --> 00:10:16.281
[ Cheers and applause ]
So, here we go.

00:10:16.281 --> 00:10:19.685
The bill is signed.
-Well, I'm sure it's bipartisan

00:10:19.685 --> 00:10:22.354
if they're signing it
exclusively on Fox News.

00:10:22.354 --> 00:10:24.523
It's like your spouse saying
they have something to tell you

00:10:24.523 --> 00:10:26.825
and they want to do it
live on "Maury."

00:10:26.825 --> 00:10:28.427
They love to pretend these are

00:10:28.427 --> 00:10:30.629
so-called nonpartisan
election integrity bills.

00:10:30.629 --> 00:10:32.297
But signing it live
on "Fox &amp; Friends"

00:10:32.297 --> 00:10:34.467
really gives the game away,
doesn't it?

00:10:34.467 --> 00:10:36.402
Like when a loan shark
knocks on your door

00:10:36.402 --> 00:10:39.038
with two goons on either side,
you know what he's there for.

00:10:39.038 --> 00:10:40.405
"I got your money! I swear!

00:10:40.405 --> 00:10:42.474
I just have to get it
out of the claw machine!"

00:10:42.474 --> 00:10:45.344
It's truly shocking to see the
actual business of government

00:10:45.344 --> 00:10:47.412
turned into a right-ring
cable-news exclusive,

00:10:47.412 --> 00:10:50.148
and on "Fox &amp; Friends," no less,
the dumbest of Fox shows.

00:10:50.148 --> 00:10:51.417
Which is saying a lot.

00:10:51.417 --> 00:10:53.686
It's like livestreaming
emergency heart surgery

00:10:53.686 --> 00:10:55.988
on "eBaum's World,"
right next to videos called

00:10:55.988 --> 00:10:57.690
"Top Ten Skateboard Fails" and

00:10:57.690 --> 00:11:00.092
"Dude Poops His Pants
in a Del Taco."

00:11:00.092 --> 00:11:02.294
The GOP has attempted
to rebrand itself

00:11:02.294 --> 00:11:05.063
as a populist pro-workers party,
but it's all a giant fraud.

00:11:05.063 --> 00:11:07.332
All they really care about
is dismantling democracy

00:11:07.332 --> 00:11:09.568
and purging anyone who disagrees
with the unhinged lie

00:11:09.568 --> 00:11:11.904
that Donald Trump actually won
the 2020 election.

00:11:11.904 --> 00:11:13.739
They don't care
what it means for you

00:11:13.739 --> 00:11:16.174
so long as Trump can say...
-I feel great.

00:11:16.174 --> 00:11:18.276
